(text "Onboard VDP VSync -> eZ80 PB1 (existing Agon board trace). Known 60 Hz mode for the first proof; no new P4 timing wire." (at 15.24 150.495 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f5edeea3-ad2d-5ccb-8706-d899391ccb34))
(text "PD4 / PD5 / PD7: isolated cable landings. No parallel handshakes, added 10k bias network, or tri-state buffers in this draft." (at 15.24 155.575 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid b7d0e3bd-f839-54e9-a7fc-fb89c331c469))
